  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르 소셜 배틀 클럽의 대부분은\n페어리타입 포켓몬을 사용하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B9740020C18CC15C0020BC30D2C00020D074B7FDC7580020B300BD80BD84C740000AD398C5B4B9ACD0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C0ACC6A9D558C8E0002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 드래곤타입 포켓몬을\n사랑하는 트레이너도 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020B4DCB798ACE4D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AC0ACB791D558B2940020D2B8B808C774B108B3C40020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아시다시피 드래곤타입의 약점은\n드래곤타입, 얼음타입,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그리고 페어리타입이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C2DCB2E4C2DCD53C0020B4DCB798ACE4D0C0C785C7580020C57DC810C740000AB4DCB798ACE4D0C0C785002C0020C5BCC74CD0C0C785002C00100001BE00000AADF8B9ACACE00020D398C5B4B9ACD0C0C785C774C5D0C694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇기에 미르 소셜 배틀 클럽에서\n드래곤타입으로 싸우면 불리한 점이 많죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AE30C5D00020BBF8B9740020C18CC15C0020BC30D2C00020D074B7FDC5D0C11C000AB4DCB798ACE4D0C0C785C73CB85C0020C2F8C6B0BA740020BD88B9ACD55C0020C810C7740020B9CEC8E0002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마치 유카리 님과\n시온 님의 관계처럼 말이에요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8CE580020C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8ACFC000AC2DCC6280020B2D8C7580020AD00ACC4CC98B7FC0020B9D0C774C5D0C694002E002E002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...생각해 보니, 두 분은 상성이 잘 맞네요.\n방금 말했던 건 잊어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC0DDAC01D5740020BCF4B2C8002C0020B4500020BD84C7400020C0C1C131C7740020C7980020B9DEB124C694002E000ABC29AE080020B9D0D588B3580020AC740020C78AC5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 이상 이야기가 옆길로 새기 전에\n본론으로 들어가죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C774C0C10020C774C57CAE30AC000020C606AE38B85C0020C0C8AE300020C804C5D0000ABCF8B860C73CB85C0020B4E4C5B4AC00C8E0002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 사랑스러운 드래곤타입 포켓몬을\n단련시키기 위해 저와 승부해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020C0ACB791C2A4B7ECC6B40020B4DCB798ACE4D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AB2E8B828C2DCD0A4AE300020C704D5740020C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해 주실 거라면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC70B77CBA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드래곤타입 포켓몬들과\n승부해 주실 건가요!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4DCB798ACE4D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC000AC2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C6940021003F00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어째서죠!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11CC8E00021003F00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "용의이빨을 지니게 한\n제 포켓몬들의 공격을 받아 보시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6A9C758C774BE68C7440020C9C0B2C8AC8C0020D55C000AC81C0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7580020ACF5ACA9C7440020BC1BC5440020BCF4C2DCC8E0002100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 포켓몬들은 아직 더 진화할 수 있어요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n처음에 말씀드렸다시피 MSBC에서\n드래곤타입을 키우는 건 힘든 일이거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7400020C544C9C10020B3540020C9C4D654D5600020C2180020C788C5B4C694002E00100001BE01000ACC98C74CC5D00020B9D0C500B4DCB838B2E4C2DCD53C0020004D005300420043C5D0C11C000AB4DCB798ACE4D0C0C785C7440020D0A4C6B0B2940020AC740020D798B4E00020C77CC774AC70B4E0C694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "공격력을 올리기 위해 용의이빨을\n지니게 했는데, 그래도 역부족인가 보네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACF5ACA9B825C7440020C62CB9ACAE300020C704D5740020C6A9C758C774BE68C744000AC9C0B2C8AC8C0020D588B294B370002C0020ADF8B798B3C40020C5EDBD80C871C778AC000020BCF4B124C694002E002E002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 슈퍼 유카리 토너먼트의 우승자이신\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님은 강하시군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020C288D37C0020C720CE74B9AC0020D1A0B108BA3CD2B8C7580020C6B0C2B9C790C774C2E0000A00100002010000000020B2D8C7400020AC15D558C2DCAD70C694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더 진화할 수 있는 포켓몬이니까\n진화의휘석을 지니게 하는 방법도 있지만...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3540020C9C4D654D5600020C2180020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774B2C8AE4C000AC9C4D654C758D718C11DC7440020C9C0B2C8AC8C0020D558B2940020BC29BC95B3C40020C788C9C0B9CC002E002E002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 따르는 시온 님의 좌우명이\n‘공격이야말로 최선의 방어’라서요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020B530B974B2940020C2DCC6280020B2D8C7580020C88CC6B0BA85C774000A2018ACF5ACA9C774C57CB9D0B85C0020CD5CC120C7580020BC29C5B42019B77CC11CC694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 유카리 님을 이기지 못하는 만큼\n시온 님께서도 자신의 좌우명을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다시 검토해 보는 게 좋을 것 같긴 하지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7440020C774AE30C9C00020BABBD558B2940020B9CCD07C000AC2DCC6280020B2D8AED8C11CB3C40020C790C2E0C7580020C88CC6B0BA85C74400100001BE00000AB2E4C2DC0020AC80D1A0D5740020BCF4B2940020AC8C0020C88BC7440020AC830020AC19AE340020D558C9C0B9CCC694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 용의이빨을 드리겠어요.\n승부해 주셔서 감사했어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020C6A9C758C774BE68C7440020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002E000AC2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD588C5B4C694002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
